玻璃到空气的临界角为30°"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】AB．作出两种情况下的光路图，如图所示\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4d9d6a31280ea1f8d0e83fbe88aa19dd7523359c7c43c9afc75456b51979c668.png","width":195,"height":183,"width_mm":51.59},{"type":"text","value":"\n设"},{"type":"math","value":"OP=x"},{"type":"text","value":"，在A处发生全反射故有\n"},{"type":"math","value":"sinC=\\frac{1}{n}=\\frac{x}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由于出射光平行可知，在B处射出，故\n"},{"type":"math","value":"n=\\frac{\\sin 60^{\\circ}}{\\sin \\angle OBP}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由于\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\angle OBP=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^{2}+R^{2}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n联立可得"},{"type":"math","value":"n=\\sqrt{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}R"},{"type":"text","value":"，故AB错误；\nC．由\n"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{c}{n}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}c"},{"type":"text","value":"，故C正确；\nD．由于\n"},{"type":"math","value":"sinC=\\frac{1}{n}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n所以临界角不为30°，故D错误。\n故选C。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007-q14","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202007-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"多选题","topics":["近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"c7a1db332e7ef8a91dba6c0a7bcbbec8f72943c541756b27b7206038576a8b23","body":[{"type":"text","value":"太阳辐射的总功率约为"},{"type":"math","value":"4\\times 10^{26}W"},{"type":"text","value":"，其辐射的能量来自于聚变反应。在聚变反应中，一个质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"1876.1MeV/c^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（c为真空中的光速）的氘核（"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{1}^{2}H"},{"type":"text","value":"）和一个质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"2809.5MeV/c^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"的氚核（"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{1}^{3}H"},{"type":"text","value":"）结合为一个质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"3728.4MeV/c^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"的氦核（"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{2}^{4}He"},{"type":"text","value":"），并放出一个X粒子，同时