type":"text","value":"时刻同时开始竖直向下振动，产生波长均为"},{"type":"math","value":"4m"},{"type":"text","value":"沿x轴传播的简谐横波。P、M、Q分别是x轴上"},{"type":"math","value":"2m"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"5m"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"8.5m"},{"type":"text","value":"的三个点，下列说法正确的是（  ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a4c0baef2597074e875d656f87a34201beab148a86014d7ba19983f87a1488b6.png","width":370,"height":55,"width_mm":78.32,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q15-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"math","value":"6.0s"},{"type":"text","value":"时P、M、Q三点均已振动"}],[{"type":"math","value":"8.0s"},{"type":"text","value":"后M点的位移始终是"},{"type":"math","value":"2cm"}],[{"type":"math","value":"10.0s"},{"type":"text","value":"后P点的位移始终是0"}],[{"type":"math","value":"10.5s"},{"type":"text","value":"时Q点的振动方向竖直向下"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"CD","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．波速为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{\\lambda}{T}=\\frac{4}{4}m/s=1m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n在6s内两列波传播了6m，则此时PQ两质点已振动，但是M点还未振动，A错误；\nB．因M点到两个振源的距离相等，则M是振动加强点，振幅为2cm，但不是位移始终为2cm，B错误；\nC．P点到两振源的距离只差为6cm，为半波长的3倍，则该点为振动减弱点，振幅为零，即10.0s后P点的位移始终为零，C正确；\nD．"},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"波源的振动传到Q点的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{10.5}{1}s=10.5s"},{"type":"text","value":"，则10.5s时Q点由"},{"type":"math","value":"S_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"引起的振动为竖直向下；"},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"波源的振动传到Q点的时间为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3.5}{1}s=3.5s"},{"type":"text","value":"，则10.5s时Q点由"},{"type":"math","value":"S_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"引起的振动已经振动了7s，此时在最高点，速度为零，则10.5s时刻Q点的振动速度为竖直向下，D正确。\n故选CD。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007-q16","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202007-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"92ecd14ff702f74b8a3352f8955b108ea17176791e69286d385d6f01f8975333","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图所示，系留无人机是利用地面直流电源通过电缆供电的无人机，旋翼由电动机带动。现有质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"20kg"},{"type":"text","value":"、额定功率为"},{"type":"math","value":"5kW"},{"type":"text","value":"的系留无人机从地面起飞沿竖直方向上升，经过"},{"type":"math","value":"200s"},{"type":"text","value":"到达"},{"type":"math","value":"100m"},{"type":"text","value":"高处后悬停并进行工作。已知直流电源供电电压为"},{"type":"math","value":"400V"},{"type":"text","value":"，若不计电缆的质量和电阻，忽略电缆对无人机的拉力，则（  ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9ff5f08f79130054dfd2679dccf3f88ada0a412f3c07b919d72a8e0af9974c5c.png","width":189,"height":168,"width_mm":39.95,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"（不计额外阻力时，重力加速度取 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\text{ m/s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"）"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"空气对无人机的作用力始终大于或等于"},{"type":"math","value":"200N"}],[{"type":"text","value":"直流电源对无人机供电的额定电流为"},{"type":"math","value":"12.5A"}],[{"type":"text","value":"无人机上升过程中消耗的平均功率为"},{"type":"math","value":"100W"}],[{"type":"text","value":"无人机上升及悬停时均有部分功率用于对空气做功"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BD","body":[{"type":"text","value":"【详解】A．无人机先向上加速后减速，最后悬停，则空气对无人机的作用力先大于200N后小于200N，最后等于200N，选项A错误；\nB．直流电源对无人机供电的额定电流\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{P}{U}=\\frac{5000}{400}A=12.5A"},{"type":"text","value":"\n选项B正确；\nC．若空气对无人机的作用力为\nF=mg=200N\n则无人机上升过程中消耗的平均功率\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\overline{P}=\\frac{Fh}{t}=\\frac{200\\times 100}{200}=100W"},{"type":"text","value":"\n但是由于空气对无人机向上的作用力不是一直为200N，则选项C错误；\nD．无人机上升及悬停时，螺旋桨会使周围空气产生流动，则会有部分功率用于对空气做功，选项D正确。\n故选BD。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007-q17","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202007-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"1ecb3c385c4b16ecc55bfb833f5bf4b503ff452e7a2c7045dd9948999876f020","body":[{"type":"text","value":"做“探究加速度与力、质量的关系”实验时，图甲是教材中的实验方案；图乙是拓展方案，其实验操作步骤如下：\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/80dfa02c9f862fd09a69b512aa74d68e8f84892e1177df0e83c7e02bca8f1514.png","width":307,"height":139,"width_mm":65.09,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q17-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9c5497ce4e8a30987f1d3b2c94a044c2d807a33d0a26222a571c064c671deb7c.png","width":274,"height":148,"width_mm":57.94,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q17-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（ⅰ）挂上托盘和砝码，改变木板的倾角，使质量为M的小车拖着纸带沿木板匀速下滑；\n（ⅱ）取下托盘和砝码，测出其总质量为m，让小车沿木板下滑，测出加速度a；\n（ⅲ）改变砝码质量和木板倾角，多次测量，通过作图可得到"},{"type":"math","value":"a-F"},{"type":"text","value":"的关系。\n①实验获得如图所示的纸带，计数点a、b、c、d、e、f间均有四个点未画出，则在打d点时小车的速度大小"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{d}="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（保留两位有效数字）；\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/60adc2c637e349efb98982bac320a4c0c357a1c97ef7427ebf4384f782bd8a7a.png","width":386,"height":92,"width_mm":81.76,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q17-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n②需要满足条件"},{"type":"math","value":"M\\gg m"},{"type":"text","value":"的方案是（填空）（选填“甲”、“乙”或“甲和乙”）；在作"},{"type":"math","value":"a-F"},{"type":"text","value":"图象时，把"},{"type":"math","value":"mg"},{"type":"text","value":"作为F值的是（填空）（选填“甲”、“乙”或“甲和乙”）。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】    （1）0.18～0.19    （2）甲    （3）甲和乙\n【详解】①．打点计时器打点周期\n"},{"type":"math","value":"T=0.1s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由匀加速直线运动中，平均速度等于中间时刻的瞬时速度可得，在打d点时小车的速度\n"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{d}=\\frac{bf}{4T}=\\frac{(38.10-30.70)\\times 10^{-2}}{4\\times 0.1}m/s\\approx 0.19m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n②．在图甲的实验方案中，由托盘和砝码的重力提供拉力，让小车做匀加速直线运动，由牛顿第二定律可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mg=(M+m)a"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则\n"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{m}{m+M}\\cdot g"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则绳子对小车的拉力\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F=Ma=\\frac{M}{m+M}\\cdot mg"},{"type":"text","value":"\n当"},{"type":"math","value":"M\\gg m"},{"type":"text","value":"时，绳子拉力近似等于托盘和砝码的重力。\n故甲需要满足"},{"type":"math","value":"M\\gg m"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n在图乙的实验方案中，挂上托盘和砝码，小车匀速下滑，设斜面的倾斜角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"，斜面和纸带对小车的摩擦力或阻力总和为f，则有\n"},{"type":"math","value":"Mgsin\\theta =f+mg"},{"type":"text","value":"\n取下托盘和砝码，小车做匀加速直线运动，由牛顿第二定律可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"Mgsin\\theta -f=Ma"},{"type":"text","value":"\n即\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mg=Ma"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故乙方案中，不需要满足"},{"type":"math","value":"M\\gg m"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n在甲乙方案中，均用托盘和砝码的重力mg作为小车匀加速的直线运动的合力及F。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007-q18","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202007-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"5f210037a96971f41286977ecdd7c618cc7d81151ada62c700e0d7317210933d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"某同学用单摆测量重力加速度，\n①为了减少测量误差，下列做法正确的是（填空）（多选）；\nA．摆的振幅越大越好\nB．摆球质量大些、体积小些\nC．摆线尽量细些、长些、伸缩性小些\nD．计时的起、止位置选在摆球达到的最高点处\n②改变摆长，多次测量，得到周期平方与摆长的关系图象如图所示，所得结果与当地重力加速度值相符，但发现其延长线没有过原点，其原因可能是（填空）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d667f2ac82011ebd45503026efe585cc497d3c914f576d146823dacd1f942468.png","width":243,"height":246,"width_mm":51.33,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA．测周期时多数了一个周期\nB．测周期时少数了一个周期\nC．测摆长时直接将摆线的长度作为摆长\nD．测摆长时将摆线的长度加上摆球的直径作为摆长"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】    （1）BC    （2）C\n【详解】①．A．单摆在摆角很小的情况下才做简谐运动，单摆的摆角不能太大，一般不能超过5°，否则单摆将不做简谐振动，故A做法错误；\nB．实验尽量选择质量大的、体积小的小球，减小空气阻力，减小实验误差，故B做法正确；\nC．为了减小实验误差，摆线应轻且不易伸长的细线，实验选择细一些的、长度适当、伸缩性小的绳子，故C做法正确；\nD．物体再平衡位置（最低点）速度最大，计时更准确，故D做法错误。\n②．单摆的周期\n"},{"type":"math","value":"T=2\\pi \\sqrt{\\frac{l}{g}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n即\n"},{"type":"math","value":"T^{2}=\\frac{4\\pi ^{2}}{g}\\cdot l"},{"type":"text","value":"\n但是实验所得"},{"type":"math","value":"T^{2}-l"},{"type":"text","value":"没过原点，测得重力加速度与当地结果相符，则斜率仍为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4\\pi ^{2}}{g}"},{"type":"text","value":"；则\n"},{"type":"math","value":"T^{2}=\\frac{4\\pi ^{2}}{g}\\cdot (l+l_{0})"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故实验可能是测量是直接将摆线的长度作为摆长了。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007-q19","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202007-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"实验题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"f00697cc76028328cdb5545549a1102c27060ac09e2c5d02a7696a2fe2d53bcc","body":[{"type":"text","value":"某同学分别用图甲和图乙的电路测量同一节干电池的电动势和内阻。\n(1)在答题纸相应的方框中画出图乙的电路图（填空）；\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/eb6e8003255f6eeda28b90950532a4b1ebc5249edd43d3d36978bbfe75866b0e.png","width":357,"height":307,"width_mm":75.67,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q19-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/30b892550eab88a86533f969ddc0f668c9c4f9d44deacd6a1f124c7937644e25.png","width":647,"height":538,"width_mm":74.61,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q19-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(2)某次测量时电流表和电压表的示数如图所示，则电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":"，电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"V"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e64ac52239a0cbad163c273250da7874c0f221d4a34c00c4ddf324e135297994.png","width":324,"height":168,"width_mm":68.53,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q19-row3"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8f14b1ed7fc3b57c77aaa9551a5ec440e67af86489d9633c71d67b972aea5a71.png","width":319,"height":154,"width_mm":67.47,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q19-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(3)实验得到如图所示的两条直线，图中直线Ⅰ对应电路是图1（填空）（选填“甲”或“乙”）；\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7c7d3c8aa74493166c5a4246af7bf17285799ad34e047c593920582c9bdbdc26.png","width":372,"height":361,"width_mm":78.85,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q19-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(4)该电池的电动势"},{"type":"math","value":"E="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）V（保留三位有效数字），内阻"},{"type":"math","value":"r="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"（保留两位有效数字）。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】    （1）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/56083d1d2d8eaed1d4a706baaaef867fccbe2743c48fc4e0474420a7fe33326c.png","width":235,"height":168,"width_mm":49.74},{"type":"text","value":"    (2). 0.39～0.41    (3). 1.29～1.31    (4). 乙    (5). 1.51～1.54    (6). 0.52～0.54\n【详解】(1)图乙中，电流表内接和变阻器串联接在电源两端，电压表测路段电压，则图乙对应的电路图为\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8cd0e88cab87cedad7d3180bd67fe18af676fbedc4d6f340b76475bcdd50d23c.png","width":562,"height":300,"width_mm":64.82},{"type":"text","value":"\n(2)一节干电池的电动势一般约为1.5V，故电压表量程选择0~3V，电流表量程选择0~0.6A，所以量表的读数分别为1.30V（1.29～1.31V均可），0.40A（0.39～0.41A均可）\n(3)由闭合电路欧姆定律可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"U=E-Ir"},{"type":"text","value":"\n可得U-I图象的纵轴截距为电源电动势，斜率为电源内阻。图甲中电流表外接，则实验测得的电源内阻\n"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{\\text{测}}=r_{\\text{内}}+r_{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n测量值偏大；图乙中电路\n"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{\\text{测}}=\\frac{r_{V}}{r_{\\text{内}}+r_{V}}r_{\\text{内}}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n测量值偏小，但是由于"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{V}\\gg r_{\\text{真}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，故图乙实验测出的内阻误差更小，故图线Ⅰ对应图乙，图线Ⅱ对应的图甲。\n(4)图线Ⅱ与纵轴的交点为电源的电动势E=1.52V ；\n在图线Ⅰ与横轴的交点为短路电流I=2.86A\n由\n"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{E}{I}=\\frac{1.52V}{2.86A}=0.53\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"\n，此实验原理无误差。"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007-q20","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202007-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"76e742b498b52978220d1771f214273c80adcfe44b04624d75dd61bb57192e8c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图1所示，有一质量"},{"type":"math","value":"m=200kg"},{"type":"text","value":"的物件在电机的牵引下从地面竖直向上经加速、匀速、匀减速至指定位置。当加速运动到总位移的"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"时开始计时，测得电机的牵引力随时间变化的"},{"type":"math","value":"F-t"},{"type":"text","value":"图线如图2所示，"},{"type":"math","value":"t=34s"},{"type":"text","value":"末速度减为0时恰好到达指定位置。若不计绳索的质量和空气阻力，求物件：\n(1)做匀减速运动的加速度大小和方向；\n(2)匀速运动的速度大小；\n(3)总位移的大小。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7523de15009bb50409d688f7bfc636b072cdee2f3339f9df8e4bdcf3edc55dd0.png","width":1046,"height":369,"width_mm":120.91,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"（不计额外阻力时，重力加速度取 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\text{ m/s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"）"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"0.125m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，竖直向下；(2)1m/s；(3)40m\n【详解】(1)由图2可知0~26s内物体匀速运动，26s~34s物体减速运动，在减速运动过程根据牛顿第二定律有\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mg-F_{T}=ma"},{"type":"text","value":"\n根据图2得此时"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{T}"},{"type":"text","value":"=1975N，则有\n"},{"type":"math","value":"a=g-\\frac{F_{T}}{m}=0.125m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n方向竖直向下。\n(2)结合图2根据运动学公式有\n"},{"type":"math","value":"v=at_{2}=0.125\\times \\left( 34-26 \\right)m/s=1m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(3)根据图像可知匀速上升的位移\n"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{1}=vt_{1}=1\\times 26m=26m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n匀减速上升的位移\n"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{2}=\\frac{v}{2}t_{2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 8m=4m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n匀加速上升的位移为总位移的"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则匀速上升和减速上升的位移为总位移的"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{3}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则有\n"},{"type":"math","value":"h_{1}+h_{2}=\\frac{3}{4}h"},{"type":"text","value":"\n所以总位移为\nh=40m"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007-q21","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202007-q21","number":"21","order":21,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"cb5082d8aa88fc80d62ed4bec75d0168052d153f1c6d715d81e8dbc9dab2967f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"小明将如图所示的装置放在水平地面上，该装置由弧形轨道、竖直圆轨道、水平直轨道"},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":"和倾角"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta =37^\\circ"},{"type":"text","value":"的斜轨道"},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":"平滑连接而成。质量"},{"type":"math","value":"m=0.1kg"},{"type":"text","value":"的小滑块从弧形轨道离地高"},{"type":"math","value":"H=1.0m"},{"type":"text","value":"处静止释放。已知"},{"type":"math","value":"R=0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{AB}=L_{BC}=1.0m"},{"type":"text","value":"，滑块与轨道"},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":"间的动摩擦因数均为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu =0.25"},{"type":"text","value":"，弧形轨道和圆轨道均可视为光滑，忽略空气阻力。\n(1)求滑块运动到与圆心O等高的D点时对轨道的压力；\n(2)通过计算判断滑块能否冲出斜轨道的末端C点；\n(3)若滑下的滑块与静止在水平直轨道上距A点x处的质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"2m"},{"type":"text","value":"的小滑块相碰，碰后一起运动，动摩擦因数仍为0.25，求它们在轨道"},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":"上到达的高度h与x之间的关系。（碰撞时间不计，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 37^\\circ =0.6"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos 37^\\circ =0.8"},{"type":"text","value":"）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ca2d4952f2ee2f866140b794a39d53314bcc94938bf0c741457964e37d9b2b3a.png","width":619,"height":254,"width_mm":110.07,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q21-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"（不计额外阻力时，重力加速度取 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\text{ m/s}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"）"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)8N，方向水平向左；(2)不会冲出；(3) "},{"type":"math","value":"h=\\frac{1}{6}x-\\frac{5}{48}"},{"type":"text","value":"（"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{5}{8}m<x\\le 1m"},{"type":"text","value":"）；"},{"type":"math","value":"h=0"},{"type":"text","value":"（"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\le x\\le \\frac{5}{8}m"},{"type":"text","value":"）\n【详解】(1)机械能守恒定律\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mgH=mgR+\\frac{1}{2}mv_{D}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n牛顿第二定律\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=\\frac{mv_{D}^{2}}{R}=8N"},{"type":"text","value":"\n牛顿第三定律\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}^{'}=F_{N}=8N"},{"type":"text","value":"\n方向水平向左\n(2)能在斜轨道上到达的最高点为"},{"type":"math","value":"C'"},{"type":"text","value":"点，功能关系\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mgH=\\mu mgL_{AB}+\\mu mgL_{BC'}\\cos \\theta +mgL_{BC'}\\sin \\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{BC'}=\\frac{15}{16}m<1.0m"},{"type":"text","value":"\n故不会冲出\n(3)滑块运动到距A点x处的速度为v，动能定理\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mgH-\\mu mgx=\\frac{1}{2}mv^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n碰撞后的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v'"},{"type":"text","value":"，动量守恒定律\n"},{"type":"math","value":"mv=3mv'"},{"type":"text","value":"\n设碰撞后滑块滑到斜轨道的高度为h，动能定理\n"},{"type":"math","value":"-3\\mu mg\\left( L_{AB}-x \\right)-3\\mu mg\\frac{h}{\\tan \\theta}-3mgh=0-\\frac{1}{2}(3m)v'^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"h=\\frac{1}{6}x-\\frac{5}{48}\\left( \\frac{5}{8}m<x⩽1m \\right)"},{"type":"math","value":"h=0\\left( 0⩽x⩽\\frac{5}{8}m \\right)"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007-q22","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202007-q22","number":"22","order":22,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"1ea4a4298d22da8a9c053163689dbd210ffeee5cfc2b1b92a2601db1fda8c585","body":[{"type":"text","value":"如图1所示，在绝缘光滑水平桌面上，以O为原点、水平向右为正方向建立x轴，在"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\le x\\le 1.0m"},{"type":"text","value":"区域内存在方向竖直向上的匀强磁场。桌面上有一边长"},{"type":"math","value":"L=0.5m"},{"type":"text","value":"、电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R=0.25\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"的正方形线框"},{"type":"math","value":"abcd"},{"type":"text","value":"，当平行于磁场边界的"},{"type":"math","value":"cd"},{"type":"text","value":"边进入磁场时，在沿x方向的外力F作用下以"},{"type":"math","value":"v=1.0m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"的速度做匀速运动，直到"},{"type":"math","value":"ab"},{"type":"text","value":"边进入磁场时撤去外力。若以"},{"type":"math","value":"cd"},{"type":"text","value":"边进入磁场时作为计时起点，在"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\le t\\le 1.0s"},{"type":"text","value":"内磁感应强度B的大小与时间t的关系如图2所示，在"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\le t\\le 1.3s"},{"type":"text","value":"内线框始终做匀速运动。\n(1)求外力F的大小；\n(2)在"},{"type":"math","value":"1.0s\\le t\\le 1.3s"},{"type":"text","value":"内存在连续变化的磁场，求磁感应强度B的大小与时间t的关系；\n(3)求在"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\le t\\le 1.3s"},{"type":"text","value":"内流过导线横截面的电荷量q。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5878e8ab074cb5af2754883c3ad97bb1896e00cf5822da7836520a98d829f45e.png","width":500,"height":135,"width_mm":132.29,"row_group":"zhenti-zj-202007-q22-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"【答案】(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"0.0625N"},{"type":"text","value":"；(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{1}{6-4t}"},{"type":"text","value":"；(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"0.5C"},{"type":"text","value":"\n【详解】(1)由图2可知"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}=0,B_{0}=0.25T"},{"type":"text","value":"，则回路电流\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{B_{0}Lv}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n安培力\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{A}=\\frac{B_{0}^{2}L^{2}}{R}v"},{"type":"text","value":"\n所以外力\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F=F_{A}=0.0625N"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(2)匀速出磁场，电流为0，磁通量不变"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Phi _{1}=\\Phi"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}=1.0s"},{"type":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}=0.5T"},{"type":"text","value":"，磁通量"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Phi _{1}=B_{1}L^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则t时刻，磁通量\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Phi =BL\\left[ L-v\\left( t-t_{1} \\right) \\right]"},{"type":"text","value":"\n解得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{1}{6-4t}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"0\\le t\\le 0.5s"},{"type":"text","value":"电荷量\n"},{"type":"math","value":"q_{1}=\\frac{B_{0}L^{2}}{R}=0.25C"},{"type":"math","value":"0.5s\\le t\\le 1.0s"},{"type":"text","value":"电荷量\n"},{"type":"math","value":"q_{2}=\\frac{B_{1}L^{2}-B_{0}L^{2}}{R}=0.25C"},{"type":"text","value":"\n总电荷量\n"},{"type":"math","value":"q=q_{1}+q_{2}=0.5C"}]}},{"id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007-q23","paper_id":"zj-zhenti--zhenti-zj-202007","source_question_id":"zhenti-zj-202007-q23","number":"23","order":23,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"c8b0763d0272e63fd9a71f19e51e8015263dff291b4c426b46743327643a8a14","