e":"text","value":"\n得粒子的速度大小\n"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{qBR}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n令c束中的离子运动轨迹对应的圆心为O，从磁场边界"},{"type":"math","value":"HG"},{"type":"text","value":"边的Q点射出，则由几何关系可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"OH=0.6R"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"s=HQ=\\sqrt{R^{2}-(0.6R)^{2}}=0.8R"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c327dfb93cbe012394056f164d152faaf4e8fd31c5d5ae5b77e39f56f798a656.png","width":266,"height":309,"width_mm":70.38},{"type":"text","value":"\n(2)a束中的离子运动轨迹对应的圆心为O’，从磁场边界"},{"type":"math","value":"HG"},{"type":"text","value":"边射出时距离H点的距离为x，由几何关系可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"HO'=aH-R=0.6R"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\sqrt{R^{2}-HO'^{2}}=0.8R"},{"type":"text","value":"\n即a、c束中的离子从同一点Q射出，离开磁场的速度分别于竖直方向的夹角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\beta"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"，由几何关系可得\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha =\\beta"},{"type":"text","value":"\n探测到三束离子，则c束中的离子恰好达到探测板的D点时，探测板与边界"},{"type":"math","value":"HG"},{"type":"text","value":"的距离最大，\n"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan \\alpha =\\frac{R-s}{L_{\\max}}=\\frac{OH}{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n则\n"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{\\max}=\\frac{4}{15}R"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(3)a或c束中每个离子动量的竖直分量\n"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{z}=pcos\\alpha =0.8qBR"},{"type":"text","value":"\n当"},{"type":"math","value":"0<L⩽\\frac{4}{15}R"},{"type":"text","value":"时所有离子都打在探测板上，故单位时间内离子束对探测板的平均作用力\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{1}=Np+2Np_{z}=2.6NqBR"},{"type":"text","value":"\n当"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4}{15}R<L⩽0.4R"},{"type":"text","value":"时， 只有b和c束中离子打在探测板上，则单位时间内离子束对探测板的平均作用力为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{2}=Np+Np_{z}=1.8NqBR"},{"type":"text","value":"\n当"},{"type":"math","value":"L>0.4R"},{"type":"text","value":"时， 只有b束中离子打在探测板上，则单位时间内离子束对探测板的平均作用力为\n"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{3}=Np=NqBR"}]}}]}
